+# Sustainable Solo Work
+
+## Core idea
+A calm, practical operating system grows one layer at a time: track opportunities, standardize intake, reuse templates, review weekly, and protect the work with boundaries.
+
+## Visual story
+A central solo-work dashboard begins overloaded and disconnected. Each beat adds one clear operating layer to a five-part system. The final frame turns those pieces into a balanced, bounded weekly plan.
+
+## Audience takeaway
+Sustainability is not extra administration. It is a strategic choice made through a few lightweight systems and explicit guardrails.
