+# Design — Sustainable Solo Work
+
+## Direction
+Editorial operating dashboard with paper cards on deep navy. A gold path connects five system nodes, while blue is reserved for active information and progress.
+
+## Layout
+Use the 120 px frame inset and reserve the bottom 120 px for progress. Headlines sit upper-left. The main diagram occupies the center and right, never entering the chrome region.
+
+## Type
+Proxima Nova with the system fallback. Headlines are 72–88 px and 900 weight. Supporting copy is at least 40 px. Labels are at least 22 px, uppercase, and widely tracked.
+
+## Motion
+One paused, seekable timeline. Each beat exits before the next appears. Cards rise 24 px and fade in with short staggered motion; connector rules draw left to right. No infinite animation. The final beat adds a gold boundary ring as the closing resolve.
